Thin preparation/execution driver for the Agents-page durable information-wait acceptance. Default is --preflight; root owns --execute.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --preflight           validate source/environment/schema only (default)
  --execute             root-owned world/browser execution
  --world WORLD         acceptance world name (default browser_wait_<HEAD10>)
  --backend-port BACKEND_PORT
